{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When magic was outlawed and mages became exiles, the dark legions broke free once more. Only forgotten elemental power can restore the glory of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Magic Great Again</strong> is a groundbreaking <strong>elemental-combination Roguelike survival game</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>eight core elements</strong>, leveling them from sparks to cataclysms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover <strong>dozens of lost formulas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge <strong>24 chapters of enemies and bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join allies to unleash <strong>co-op resonance magic</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Core Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Elements \u00d7 Infinite Combinations</strong>: Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, Wind, Water, Light, Dark; growth from Lv1\u2192Lv5; forbidden formulas unlocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor-Style Auto Combat</strong>: spells auto-cast so you can focus on survival and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Resonance Magic</strong>: empowered 2-player combos, 4-player <i>Elemental Judgement</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Immersive Fantasy World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Story</strong>: Magic outlawed \u2192 Darkness returns \u2192 Mages vow revival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Chapters</strong>: Ashen Harbor, Forbidden Forest, Thunder Plains, Collapse of the Void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong>: unique mechanics and co-op challenges in every chapter</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 A Feast of Visuals &amp; Sound</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular spell effects: Firestorm, Judgement Flame, Dark Lightning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and epic orchestral score</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Eight elements \u00d7 countless combinations<br>\u2705 Auto-casting combat, easy to learn, deep to master<br>\u2705 1\u20134 player support: solo epic or co-op spectacle<br>\u2705 Roguelike replayability<br>\u2705 Stunning visuals &amp; immersive sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the epic journey of magical revival, and prove you are worthy to Make Magic Great Again!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020120?t=1760013338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020120/fda188b6cb63a473c7525d5bc6bae283d21225cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760013338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020120/5368b64dc40f335fe6c8022b98b707da6638a7a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760013338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020120/5368b64dc40f335fe6c8022b98b707da6638a7a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760013338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4020170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When magic was outlawed and mages became exiles, the dark legi